<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian national weather - July 4.</title>
<headline>Australian national weather - July 4.</headline>
<text>
<p>NATIONAL WEATHER: FRIDAY JULY 4, 1997</p>
<p>CAIRNS.  Light showers  25</p>
<p>    TOWNSVILLE............  Shower or two  26</p>
<p>    BRISBANE..............  Fine  20</p>
<p>SYDNEY.  Coastal shower  15</p>
<p>    CANBERRA..............  Fine, partly cloudy  11</p>
<p>    MELBOURNE.............  Mainly fine  14</p>
<p>HOBART.  Light showers  10</p>
<p>    ADELAIDE..............  Fine  15</p>
<p>DARWIN.  Fine, dry  30</p>
<p>PERTH..  Cloudy  16</p>
<p>    ALICE SPRINGS.........  Mainly fine  19</p>
<p>-- Reuters Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
